    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT9_INTRO"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I've noticed that the zombies' attacks always follow a strange pattern.",
              "zh": "我注意到僵尸们的进攻总是遵循一条奇怪的规律。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "If a newly arrived wave takes too much damage, the next wave will launch its attack early.",
              "zh": "如果新到场的一波僵尸受到过于严重的伤害，下一波僵尸就会提早发动进攻。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "So hittin' zombies fast and hard ain't such a hot idea.",
              "zh": "要对付僵尸，看来速战速决不是个好主意。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Try stalling the zombies on the lawn - don't attack them until the next wave arrives. That should buy us more time to set up our defenses.",
              "zh": "试试拖延场上的僵尸，直至下一波僵尸到场前不要攻击它们。这样也许能为我们争取到更多布阵时间。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Then we gotta be real careful! Don't let those Potato Mines blow the zombies up too fast!",
              "zh": "那可千万得小心！别让那些土豆地雷把僵尸太早炸死！"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT9_INTRO2"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
